<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>공시리 — 빈 점포 활용 추천·입점 연결 플랫폼</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.min.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css">
<style>
:root{
  --teal:#0e6b5c; --teal-dark:#0a5347; --mint:#e8f5f1; --mint2:#d2ece4;
  --ink:#14181b; --gray:#8a9299; --line:#e7ebee; --bg:#f6f8f9;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
html,body{height:100%}
body{font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,-apple-system,'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;background:#dfe5e8;color:var(--ink)}
.app{position:relative;max-width:430px;margin:0 auto;height:100dvh;background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
@media(min-width:480px){
  body{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  .app{height:92dvh;border-radius:36px;box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.28);border:1px solid #c9d2d6}
}
.header{padding:14px 18px 10px;background:var(--bg);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;z-index:5}
.logo-badge{width:42px;height:42px;flex:none}
.logo-txt{line-height:1.15}
.logo-txt b{font-size:21px;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-.5px}
.logo-txt span{display:block;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--teal);font-weight:600}
.header .bell{margin-left:auto;width:38px;height:38px;border:none;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.06);font-size:17px;cursor:pointer}
.screen{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:0 18px 96px;display:none;scrollbar-width:none}
.screen::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.screen.active{display:block}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0e6b5c,#128a72);border-radius:22px;padding:20px 18px;color:#fff;margin-top:6px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-38px;top:-38px;width:140px;height:140px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
.hero small{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;opacity:.85}
.hero h2{font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;margin:6px 0 10px;letter-spacing:-.4px}
.hero p{font-size:12.5px;opacity:.85;line-height:1.5}
.hero .hero-btn{margin-top:12px;display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;padding:9px 16px;border-radius:999px;border:none;cursor:pointer}
.search{margin-top:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.05);cursor:pointer}
.search span{color:var(--gray);font-size:13.5px}
.chips{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none}
.chips::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.chip{flex:none;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 13px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:#4a5458;cursor:pointer}
.chip.on{background:var(--teal);color:#fff;border-color:var(--teal)}
.sec-title{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;margin:22px 0 10px}
.sec-title h3{font-size:16.5px;letter-spacing:-.3px}
.sec-title button{border:none;background:none;color:var(--gray);font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
.stat-row{display:flex;gap:10px}
.stat{flex:1;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:14px 12px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.04);text-align:center}
.stat b{display:block;font-size:19px;color:var(--teal)}
.stat span{font-size:11px;color:var(--gray);font-weight:600}
.gov-banner{margin-top:14px;background:var(--mint);border:1px solid var(--mint2);border-radius:16px;padding:14px 15px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;cursor:pointer}
.gov-banner .ico{font-size:22px}
.gov-banner b{font-size:13.5px;display:block}
.gov-banner p{font-size:11.5px;color:#5b6b66;margin-top:2px}
.card{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:14px;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05);margin-bottom:12px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid transparent;transition:.15s}
.card:active{transform:scale(.985)}
.card-top{display:flex;gap:12px}
.thumb{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:14px;flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:26px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--mint),#f2faf7)}
.card-top h4{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.2px}
.card-top .addr{font-size:12px;color:var(--gray);margin-top:3px}
.badges{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.badge{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--mint);color:var(--teal)}
.badge.gray{background:#f1f3f4;color:#7a838a}
.badge.dark{background:#14181b;color:#fff}
.card-info{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:12px;padding-top:11px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.card-info div{flex:1}
.card-info small{display:block;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--gray);font-weight:600}
.card-info b{font-size:13.5px}
.fitbar{height:6px;border-radius:99px;background:#eef1f3;margin-top:10px;overflow:hidden}
.fitbar i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#14a085,var(--teal))}
.fit-txt{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px;margin-top:5px;color:var(--gray);font-weight:600}
.fit-txt b{color:var(--teal)}
#screen-map{padding:0 0 96px;display:none;flex-direction:column}
#screen-map.active{display:flex}
.map-head{padding:6px 18px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.map-head h3{font-size:16.5px}
.map-head span{font-size:12px;color:var(--gray);font-weight:600}
#map{flex:1;z-index:1}
.map-fallback{padding:20px}
.pin{background:var(--teal);color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:11px;padding:6px 9px;border-radius:12px 12px 12px 2px;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(14,107,92,.4);white-space:nowrap;border:2px solid #fff}
.pin.pop{background:#14181b}
.leaflet-popup-content{margin:10px 12px;font-family:inherit}
.pop-card b{font-size:14px}
.pop-card p{font-size:12px;color:#666;margin:4px 0 8px}
.pop-card button{background:var(--teal);color:#fff;border:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:9px;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}
#screen-detail{position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--bg);z-index:30;display:none;flex-direction:column}
#screen-detail.active{display:flex}
.detail-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:14px 16px 8px;background:var(--bg)}
.detail-head button{border:none;background:#fff;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:11px;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}
.detail-body{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:0 18px 30px;scrollbar-width:none}
.detail-body::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.d-photo{height:150px;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#bfe3d8,#e6f4ee);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:56px;margin-top:4px}
.d-title{margin-top:14px}
.d-title h2{font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.4px}
.d-title p{font-size:13px;color:var(--gray);margin-top:3px}
.grid4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:16px}
.grid4 .cell{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:12px 13px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
.grid4 small{display:block;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--gray);font-weight:700}
.grid4 b{font-size:14.5px}
.panel{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.05);margin-top:14px}
.panel h4{font-size:14.5px;margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.near-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.near-chips span{background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:7px 11px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600}
.chart{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:3px;height:110px;margin-top:6px}
.chart .bar{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center;gap:4px;height:100%}
.chart .bar i{width:100%;border-radius:4px 4px 2px 2px;background:#dfe6e3;display:block}
.chart .bar.peak i{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#14a085,var(--teal))}
.chart .bar em{font-style:normal;font-size:8.5px;color:var(--gray)}
.peak-note{margin-top:9px;font-size:12px;background:var(--mint);color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 11px}
.ai-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f6b5c,#0b4f44);color:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}
.ai-card .tag{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);display:inline-block;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:8px}
.ai-card h3{font-size:17px;margin:9px 0 4px}
.ai-card .why{margin-top:10px}
.ai-card .why li{font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55;margin-left:16px;margin-bottom:5px;opacity:.94}
.ai-card .caution{margin-top:11px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px}
.ai-card .caution b{font-size:11.5px}
.ai-card .caution li{font-size:11.5px;margin-left:16px;line-height:1.5;opacity:.9}
.calc-row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:9px}
.calc-row select{flex:1;padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;font-family:inherit;font-size:12.5px;background:#fff}
.calc-out{background:var(--bg);border-radius:13px;padding:13px;margin-top:4px}
.calc-out div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12.5px;padding:3px 0}
.calc-out b{color:var(--teal)}
.calc-note{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--gray);margin-top:8px;line-height:1.5}
.d-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.btn{flex:1;border:none;border-radius:14px;padding:15px;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit}
.btn.primary{background:var(--teal);color:#fff}
.btn.dark{background:#14181b;color:#fff}
.btn.ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--teal);border:1.5px solid var(--teal)}
.field{margin-bottom:15px}
.field label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px}
.field .opts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.opt{border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:9px 13px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:#4a5458}
.opt.on{border-color:var(--teal);background:var(--mint);color:var(--teal);font-weight:800}
input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:var(--teal)}
.range-val{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--teal);font-weight:800;margin-top:4px}
.big-btn{width:100%;background:var(--teal);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:15px;padding:16px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;margin-top:4px}
.gov-card{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.05);margin-bottom:12px}
.gov-card .from{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;color:var(--teal);background:var(--mint);padding:4px 9px;border-radius:8px;display:inline-block}
.gov-card h4{font-size:15px;margin:9px 0 5px}
.gov-card p{font-size:12.5px;color:#5b646a;line-height:1.6}
.gov-card .link-btn{margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:var(--teal);background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:0}
.list-row{background:#fff;border-radius:15px;padding:14px 15px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.04);margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px}
.list-row .ico{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--mint);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;flex:none}
.list-row b{font-size:13.5px;display:block}
.list-row span{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--gray)}
.list-row .st{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:var(--teal);background:var(--mint);padding:5px 9px;border-radius:8px;flex:none}
.nav{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;padding:8px 6px calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));z-index:20}
.nav button{flex:1;border:none;background:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:3px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit}
.nav .ni{font-size:19px;filter:grayscale(1);opacity:.55}
.nav span{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gray)}
.nav button.on .ni{filter:none;opacity:1}
.nav button.on span{color:var(--teal)}
.modal-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(15,20,22,.5);z-index:50;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:26px}
.modal-bg.active{display:flex}
.modal{background:#fff;border-radius:22px;padding:24px 20px;width:100%;text-align:center}
.modal .m-ico{font-size:40px}
.modal h3{font-size:17px;margin:12px 0 7px}
.modal p{font-size:13px;color:#5b646a;line-height:1.6}
.modal .big-btn{margin-top:16px}
.footnote{font-size:10.5px;color:#9aa3a8;text-align:center;margin:18px 0 4px;line-height:1.5}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
  <div class="header">
    <svg class="logo-badge" viewBox="0 0 100 84" aria-label="공시리 로고">
      <path d="M12 78 V32 Q12 10 34 10 H66 Q88 10 88 32 V78" fill="none" stroke="#0e6b5c" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <circle cx="40" cy="56" r="17" fill="none" stroke="#0e6b5c" stroke-width="7"/>
      <path d="M40 56 m-8 0 a8 8 0 1 1 16 0 a5 5 0 1 1 -10 0" fill="none" stroke="#0e6b5c" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <circle cx="60" cy="43" r="5.5" fill="#0e6b5c"/>
      <circle cx="67" cy="38" r="3" fill="#0e6b5c"/>
    </svg>
    <div class="logo-txt">
      <b>공시리</b>
      <span>공실을 창업가에 잇는 플랫폼</span>
    </div>
    <button class="bell" onclick="openModal('알림','새로운 공실이 2곳 등록되었습니다.<br>· 용봉로 1층 점포 (단기 가능)<br>· 후문 골목 2층 (공방 추천)')">🔔</button>
  </div>

  <div class="screen active" id="screen-home">
    <div class="hero">
      <small>전남대 후문 상권 시범 운영 중</small>
      <h2>비어 있는 점포,<br>가장 잘 맞는 사람과 잇다</h2>
      <p>공실의 공간 조건과 주변 상권 데이터를 분석해<br>적합한 업종과 단기 활용 방안을 추천합니다.</p>
      <button class="hero-btn" onclick="showTab('map')">🗺️ 공실 지도 보기</button>
    </div>
    <div class="search" onclick="showTab('match')"><span>🔍</span><span>예산·기간·용도로 공간 찾기</span></div>
    <div class="chips">
      <div class="chip on">전체</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="showTab('match')">🎪 팝업스토어</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="showTab('match')">📅 단기 임대</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="showTab('match')">🚀 창업 공간</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="showTab('match')">🖼️ 전시·행사</div>
    </div>
    <div class="sec-title"><h3>전남대 후문 공실 현황</h3><button onclick="showTab('map')">지도 보기 ›</button></div>
    <div class="stat-row">
      <div class="stat"><b>7</b><span>등록 공실</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>4</b><span>단기 이용 가능</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>5</b><span>지원사업 연계</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="gov-banner" onclick="showTab('benefit')">
      <div class="ico">🏛️</div>
      <div>
        <b>정부·지자체 지원사업 연계 가능</b>
        <p>북구 상권 활성화 사업 · 임대료 지원 등 확인하기</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sec-title"><h3>AI 추천 공실</h3><button onclick="showTab('map')">전첳보기 ›</button></div>
    <div id="home-cards"></div>
    <p class="footnote">본 화면의 점포 정보는 서비스 구조를 보여주기 위한 시연용 예시 데이터입니다.<br>실제 운영 시 임대인 등록과 상인회 현장 확인을 거쳐 게시됩니다.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="screen" id="screen-map">
    <div class="map-head"><h3>공실 지도</h3><span>전남대 후문 · 용봉동 일대</span></div>
    <div id="map"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="screen" id="screen-match">
    <div class="sec-title" style="margin-top:8px"><h3>조건으로 공간 찾기</h3></div>
    <div class="panel" style="margin-top:0">
      <div class="field">
        <label>사용 목적</label>
        <div class="opts" id="m-purpose">
          <div class="opt on" data-v="팝업스토어">🎪 팝업스토어</div>
          <div class="opt" data-v="창업">🚀 창업 공간</div>
          <div class="opt" data-v="전시행사">🖼️ 전시·행사</div>
          <div class="opt" data-v="공방클스">🎨 공방·클스</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label>월 예산 (임대료 기준)</label>
        <input type="range" id="m-budget" min="30" max="150" step="10" value="70" oninput="document.getElementById('budget-val').textContent='월 '+this.value+'만 원 이하'">
        <div class="range-val" id="budget-val">월 70만 원 이하</div>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label>사용 기간</label>
        <div class="opts" id="m-period">
          <div class="opt on" data-v="1주~1개월">1주~1개월</div>
          <div class="opt" data-v="1~3개월">1~3개월</div>
          <div class="opt" data-v="3~6개월">3~6개월</div>
          <div class="opt" data-v="장기 검토">장기 검토</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label>필수 조건 (복수 선택)</label>
        <div class="opts" id="m-fac">
          <div class="opt" data-v="1층">1층</div>
          <div class="opt" data-v="급배수">급배수</div>
          <div class="opt" data-v="화장실">화장실</div>
          <div class="opt" data-v="주차">주차 가능</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="big-btn" onclick="runMatch()">AI 매칭 시작</button>
    </div>
    <div id="match-results"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="screen" id="screen-benefit">
    <div class="sec-title" style="margin-top:8px"><h3>연계 가능한 지원사업</h3></div>
    <div class="gov-card">
      <span class="from">전남광주통합특별시 북구</span>
      <h4>전남대 후문 상권 활성화 사업</h4>
      <p>북구가 상인회·전남대 총학생회와 상생협약을 체결하고 '공실 점포 활용 및 환경 개선 방안'을 주제로 아이디어를 공모 중입니다. 채택안은 상권 활성화 기본계획에 반영될 예정으로, 공시리는 해당 계획의 매칭 도구로 연계를 목표로 합니다.</p>
